abstract: >
  ai-privacy-risk-assessor is a standalone Python tool for AI Privacy Impact
  Assessment across CLI, REST API, MCP, and web-form interfaces. It implements
  a research-grounded taxonomy of AI and AI+Quantum data privacy risks derived
  from two published 2025 arXiv papers.
keywords:
  - privacy
  - privacy impact assessment
  - AI privacy
  - quantum AI
  - MCP
  - FastAPI
  - risk taxonomy
